<title>USA: International Airline Support Q1 net down.</title>
<headline>International Airline Support Q1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 ended August 31, 1996.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.30		   $ 2.80</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 2.25		     2.55</p>
<p> Net			344,068		  418,846</p>
<p> Revs		   4,158,671		4,959,929</p>
<p>NOTE: The company attributed lower revenues to lower lease revenue in 1996.</p>
